                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.6363 Standard Oil/39: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Persia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-10-14T10:00:00+03:25"><hi rendition="#italic">October 14,
                                1921—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 15—6:22
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>62. British Chargé d’Affaires has received instructions to reemphasize protest
                    referred to in the Legation’s 52, September 4th, and 59, September 21st.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
